    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that keeps you company when you need quiet time. Choose your favorite partner and find a scene that satisfies you. Whether you are studying or working, you will get twice the result with half the effort.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a quiet atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/ca00887242e7bdba677b528ab4849862.poster.avif?t=1751293231\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/ca00887242e7bdba677b528ab4849862.webm?t=1751293231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/ca00887242e7bdba677b528ab4849862.mp4?t=1751293231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partners with personality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/3f300909572b11dd452914250523a127.poster.avif?t=1751293231\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/3f300909572b11dd452914250523a127.webm?t=1751293231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/3f300909572b11dd452914250523a127.mp4?t=1751293231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various interesting scenes and dialogues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/3a586ff5cd0349761e0d5f9a8bf185da.poster.avif?t=1751293231\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/3a586ff5cd0349761e0d5f9a8bf185da.webm?t=1751293231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/3a586ff5cd0349761e0d5f9a8bf185da.mp4?t=1751293231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini games that help you get rid of sleepiness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/efcb73638a5c8acb3b487dd27ae6901a.poster.avif?t=1751293231\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/efcb73638a5c8acb3b487dd27ae6901a.webm?t=1751293231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730000/extras/efcb73638a5c8acb3b487dd27ae6901a.mp4?t=1751293231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing and casual simulation game. Use tools such as countdown and focus alarm to improve your concentration efficiency. Your partners will talk and interact with you, and you can improve their favorability through these.</p>",
